# 🤖 AI Customer Support Agent

An intelligent and customizable AI Customer Support Agent built with RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation).

This agent can be integrated into almost any website as a chat-based customer support system. Users can communicate with the agent in either Bangla or English, and the agent responds based on the business's own knowledge base.

---

## 🚀 Project Overview

This project is designed to help businesses automate their customer support using AI.

Instead of giving generic AI-generated answers, the agent retrieves relevant information from the business knowledge base and uses that information to provide accurate and context-aware responses.

The agent can understand user questions, identify their intent, retrieve relevant information, and generate helpful responses.

