## 🏗️ How It Works

The system follows a simple RAG-based workflow:

User Question  
↓  
AI Customer Support Agent  
↓  
Query Understanding  
↓  
Pinecone Knowledge Base Search  
↓  
Relevant Information Retrieved  
↓  
AI Generates Response  
↓  
Response Sent to Website Chat

---

## 🧩 Technology Stack

- **n8n** – Workflow automation
- **RAG** – Retrieval-Augmented Generation
- **Pinecone** – Vector database
- **LLM** – AI response generation
- **Website Chat Interface** – Customer interaction

