## 📚 Knowledge Base

The agent uses a business-specific knowledge base to answer customer questions.

The knowledge base can contain information such as:

- Services
- Pricing
- Products
- Frequently Asked Questions
- Policies
- Business information
- Customer support information

The AI agent retrieves relevant information from the knowledge base before generating a response.

---

## 💬 Multilingual Support

The agent can communicate with users in multiple languages.

For example:

**User:**
> আপনার AI automation service এর দাম কত?

The agent can understand the Bangla question and provide an appropriate answer based on the available business information.

Users can also communicate in English.

---

## 🌐 Website Integration

The AI Customer Support Agent is designed to work with a website chat interface.

The chat interface can be embedded into a business website so visitors can communicate with the AI agent directly.

This allows businesses to provide automated customer support without requiring a human representative to answer every common question.

