## 🔐 Accuracy & Reliability

The agent is instructed to prioritize information retrieved from the business knowledge base.

It should not invent:

- Prices
- Services
- Policies
- Features
- Business information

If the required information is unavailable, the agent should clearly communicate that it does not have enough information instead of making up an answer.

