## 📌 Example

A customer visits a business website and asks:

> "What services do you provide?"

The AI agent searches the business knowledge base and provides the relevant services.

Another customer can ask:

> "আপনাদের সার্ভিসের দাম কত?"

The agent understands the Bangla query and retrieves the appropriate pricing information from the knowledge base.

